{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06279","headline":"鴈门胡人歌 · 崔颢","name":"鴈门胡人歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高山代郡东接燕，鴈门胡人家近边。\n解放胡鹰逐塞鸟，能将代马猎秋田。\n山头野火寒多烧，雨里孤峰湿作烟。\n闻道辽西无鬬战，时时醉向酒家眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}